+### Compound Durations
+
+`parseCompound` sums several number+unit pieces. Pieces can be separated by spaces, commas, or nothing at all.
+
+```ts
+import { parseCompound } from 'ms'
+
+parseCompound('1h 30m')         // 5400000
+parseCompound('1h, 30m')        // 5400000
+parseCompound('2 days 4 hours') // 187200000
+```
+
+Every piece needs a unit (a bare number is only allowed on its own, like `parse`). Invalid input, such as `''`, `'abc'`, or `'1h foo'`, throws a `TypeError` that includes the input; it never returns `NaN`.
+
 ### Input Formats (Units)
 
 ```ts
